    {
      "title": "Principal Shareholders",
      "excerpt": "Principal Shareholders \u201d),\nand Wenfang Song, an individual, solely in his capacity as the shareholder representative, agent and attorney-in-fact of the Principal\nShareholder. Pursuant to the Merger Agreement, the aggregate consideration for the Acquisition Merger (the \u201c Merger Consideration \u201d)\nis $920,000,000, payable to the Isdera Group Shareholders in the form of newly issued PubCo Ordinary Shares (as defined below) valued\nat $10.00 per share. The calculation of the Merger Consideration would result in the aggregate issuance to the Isdera Group Shareholders\nat the Closing (as defined below), of 92,000,000 PubCo Ordinary Shares (the \u201c Closing Payment Shares \u201d). Upon the Closing of the\nBusiness Combination, the ordinary shares of PubCo will be comprised into class\u00a0A ordinary shares of a par value of US$0.0001 each\n(\u201c PubCo Class\u00a0A Ordinary Shares \u201d) and class\u00a0B ordinary shares of a par v",
